- 子任务2-2：睡前1小时避免使用电子设备，可听轻音乐助眠\n- **主任务3：稳定每日步数**\n  - 子任务3-1：每日上午、下午各安排1次10分钟步行活动\n  - 子任务3-2：每日步数目标达成8,000步以上","model_name":"agent-BDF88EAF-6D5E-4308-B7BB-13F1E37C018C","client_message_id":"b86404f4-d85c-490c-b8e1-649e86149a49","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-04-28 01:09:51.566000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"agent-BDF88EAF-6D5E-4308-B7BB-13F1E37C018C","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","attachments":[],"blocks":[],"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"}]}
